<h4>Venture Acceleration</h4>
<p>We help globally-minded startups navigate complexity, build credibility, and connect with capital and clients, transforming breakthrough technologies into market-leading solutions. We partner with mission-driven startups to scale for success.</div></div>  <a  href="/global-venture-acceleration-emerging-tech-enablement/" class="box-link"></a></div> </div></div></div></div><div class="cell  flex_gap_desktop_10px "><div class="inner-wrap-outer"><div class="inner-wrap" style="background-color: #095aa6;"><div class="nectar-fancy-box   has-animation" data-style="color_box_hover" data-animation="fade-in-from-right" data-hover-o="default" data-border-radius="default" data-border="" data-box-color-opacity="1" data-delay="500" data-alignment="left" data-color="extra-color-1" ><div class="box-inner-wrap"><div class="box-bg" role="presentation" ></div> <div class="inner" style="min-height: 400px"><div class="inner-wrap"><span class="im-icon-wrap" data-color="extra-color-1"><span><svg role="presentation" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="50" height="50" viewBox="0 0 32 32">
