<h4>Training</h4>
<p>We believe that information is power—and those who harness it effectively gain a decisive advantage. Future global leaders need to learn both the art and the science of the simultaneity of competition and collaboration, if they are to succeed in the future.</div></div>  <a  href="/lifelong-learning/" class="box-link"></a></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="divider-wrap" data-alignment="default"><div style="height: 25px;" class="divider"></div></div>
			</div> 
		</div>
	</div> 
</div></div>
